(1201307,15,2,'Pink Frog',7913,1,36000,5500,0,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,1000,1200703,-1,1,'"Delicate and enchanting, this rare frog species captivates with its vibrant pink hue, believed to bring good fortune and prosperity to its owner."',0,0),
