(1206607,'Purple Gargantuan Murloc',15798,4,20,0,1,'This majestic murloc commands attention with its purple hue.'),
(1206608,'Black Crane',15798,1,20,0,1,'A graceful black-feathered crane, symbolizing balance and serenity.'),
(1206609,'Ivory Crane',15798,1,20,0,1,'With its pristine white feathers, this crane is a vision of purity.'),
(1206610,'Pink Crane',15798,1,20,0,1,'A rare and beautiful crane with a soft pink plumage.'),
(1206611,'D.L.U. Zeppelin',15798,1,20,0,1,'An airship built for speed and high-altitude adventure.'),
(1206612,'Golden Foxwyvern',15798,1,20,0,1,'A majestic wyvern with shimmering golden fur and wings.'),
(1206618,'Hand of Icecrown',15798,1,20,0,1,'An undead mount, raised to serve the Lich King\'s will.'),
(1206619,'Hand of Menethil',15798,1,20,0,1,'This mount bears the strength of the fallen kingdom of Lordaeron.'),
(1206620,'Hand of Death',15798,1,20,0,1,'A terrifying mount, shrouded in darkness and decay.'),
(1206621,'Shu-Zen, Faithful Companion',15798,4,20,0,1,'A loyal companion, offering comfort and courage in battle.'),
(1206622,'Celestial Fox',15798,1,20,0,1,'A mystical fox, adorned with the power of the stars.'),
(1206626,'Honeyback Harvester',15798,1,20,0,1,'A bee mount, prized for its sweet nature and loyal heart.'),
(1206639,'Outlandish Nether Ray',15798,1,20,0,1,'Ethereal and strange, the Outlandish Nether Ray drifts through the skies of Outland.'),
(1206640,'Draenic Nether Ray',15798,1,20,0,1,'A common sight over Draenei lands, this Nether Ray is a majestic flier.'),
(1206655,'Plagued Riding Spider',7368,4,20,0,1,'Born of plague and shadow, this monstrous spider skitters forth from Naxxramas, its twisted form a testament to the horrors of the Scourge.'),
(1200873,'Nordrassil Stag',23358,4,20,0,1,'A majestic steed imbued with the ancient power of Nordrassil, its hooves carry the echoes of nature\'s strength.'),
(1203630,'Ivory Boar',34379,4,20,0,1,'Believed to descend from the legendary Agamaggan, these boars are now esteemed companions and mounts of the Razorfen tribe.'),
(1203631,'Plagued Boar',8802,4,20,0,1,'Even the incredibly resilient boars stand no chance against the overwhelming might of the Scourge.'),
(1203633,'Black Boar',1200824,4,20,0,1,'Summon the Black Boar, a fierce companion with a taste for adventure!'),
(1204442,'Immortal Champion\'s Charger',30608,4,60,0,1,'But the most important rule, the rule you can never forget, no matter how much he cries, no matter how much he begs, never feed him after midnight.'),
(1204692,'Blackstone Dragon Guard',34380,4,20,0,1,'Dragonhawks are among the deadliest known predators. They are able to spot prey from great distances, rush in, and rend with both talon and beak.'),
(1205003,'Ice Raptor',17494,4,20,0,1,'"This sleek and agile raptor is adapted to the harsh, icy environments of the north. Its sharp claws and teeth make it a formidable mount in battle."'),
(1205006,'Kul Tiran Warhorse',25132,4,20,0,1,'The Kul Tiran Warhorse is a sturdy and reliable mount, bred for battle and unafraid of danger. Its massive size and strength make it a formidable ally in combat.'),
(1205007,'Greymane Charger',25132,4,20,0,1,'The Greymane Charger is a symbol of the Gilnean strength and resilience. Its sleek, silver coat and lightning-fast speed make it a favorite among Gilnean soldiers.'),
(1205009,'Grim Totem Kodo',29448,4,20,0,1,'"The Grim Totem Kodo is a massive, hulking beast, feared by many for its sheer size and strength. Those who ride it are said to have the power of the earth at their command."'),
(1205355,'Invincible',17786,4,20,0,1,'The famous steed of Arthas Menethil, who serves its master in life and in death. Riding him is truly a feat of strength.'),
(1208631,'Molten Corehound',28258,4,20,0,1,'The Molten Corehound is a fierce, two-headed beast engulfed in flames, forged in the fiery depths of the Molten Core.'),
(1208632,'Tel\'Abim Gorilla',26461,4,20,0,6,'Ride the Tel\'Abim Gorilla, a banana-powered beast ready to smash through anything in its path!'),
(1208633,'Felforged Dreadhound',9826,4,20,0,1,'A brutal predator twisted by fel magic, relentless in its thirst for battle and destruction.');
