(1200988,15,2,'Lost Farm Sheep',7361,1,0,0,0,1,15,1000,1200681,1500,1,'A friendly farm sheep that wandered away from its flock, it now follows you faithfully, providing a comforting presence in the midst of your adventures.',0),
